# Zip Archive of the src dir splits 10 files a part
/archive/

# Editor backup files — stale duplicates of real sources; keep them out of
# git AND out of ripgrep/Grep results (rg honours .gitignore), so searches
# never return dead copies of a file alongside the live one.
*~
*.orig
*.bak
